      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-121329",
      ":question/problem": "Wendy is reading a $400$-page book she took out from the library. She read $76$ pages on the first day, $68$ on the second day, $60$ on the third day, and so on. If this trend continued, how many pages did Wendy read on the day she finished the book?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
